# Real secret values for the ${VAR} placeholders in application*.properties
# and docker-compose*.yml - never commit these. .env = local/dev (matches
# application.properties), .env.prod = prod (matches application.prod.properties,
# has a different ONELIKE_DB_PASSWORD).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example

